note\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"43.8\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,88.4 9.1,71.9 14.2,75.2 19.3,75.0 24.5,77.3 29.6,76.3 34.7,81.1 39.8,74.0 44.9,67.3 50.0,71.7 55.1,78.0 60.3,77.1 65.4,73.8 70.5,68.5 75.6,71.2 80.7,67.7 85.8,70.2 91.0,75.6 96.1,73.6 101.2,67.3 106.3,43.6 111.4,33.5 116.5,35.2 121.6,40.0 126.8,52.0 131.9,55.1 137.0,63.3 142.1,65.4 147.2,66.2 152.3,72.3 157.4,73.8 162.6,74.4 167.7,80.9 172.8,82.6 177.9,84.2 183.0,97.2 188.1,95.6 193.2,89.5 198.4,89.5 203.5,88.6 208.6,82.8 213.7,79.8 218.8,80.9 223.9,79.0 229.0,71.0 234.2,59.3 239.3,63.1 244.4,60.1 249.5,54.3 254.6,47.1 259.7,28.7 264.9,13.0 270.0,27.4 275.1,24.1 280.2,30.6 285.3,38.1 290.4,28.7 295.5,22.2 300.7,26.8 305.8,23.4 310.9,22.8 316.0,12.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 100.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 285.3 50.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"12.8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"57.5\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opac